  "key": 54323,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityEastHouse_Text_MayISeeNatures",
      "en_US": [
        "That glaringly bright and cool thing\n",
        "you have!\r",
        "It’s undoubtedly a Pokétch!\n",
        "The latest model, no less!\r",
        "They’re awesome, yeah?\r",
        "I got OK’d by the Pokétch Company\n",
        "to develop original Pokétch apps.\r",
        "Hey, you’re a Trainer, right?\n",
        "Can you do me a favor?\r",
        "You’ve got Pokémon with different\n",
        "natures, right? May I see them?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Eh, mais ce truc cool qui brille à \n",
        "ton poignet... Mais oui, c’est ça!\r",
        "C’est une Pokémontre! \n",
        "Et le dernier modèle, avec ça!\r",
        "J’ai eu l’accord de la Pokémontre S.A. \n",
        "pour développer des logiciels\f",
        "Pokémontre.\r",
        "Mais, tu es un Dresseur, non?\n",
        "Tu peux me rendre un service?\r",
        "Tu as bien des Pokémon de différentes \n",
        "natures? Je peux les voir?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityEastHouse_Text_LikeToSeeSeriousNature",
      "en_US": [
        "What am I in the mood to see now...\r",
        "I’d like to see a Pokémon with\n",
        "a Serious nature."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Qu’est-ce que j’aimerais voir...\r",
        "J’aimerais voir un Pokémon Sérieux."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityEastHouse_Text_LikeToSeeNaiveNature",
      "en_US": [
        "What am I in the mood to see now...\r",
        "I’d like to see a Pokémon with\n",
        "a Naive nature."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Qu’est-ce que j’aimerais voir...\r",
        "J’aimerais voir un Pokémon Naïf."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityEastHouse_Text_LikeToSeeQuirkyNature",
      "en_US": [
        "What am I in the mood to see now...\r",
        "I’d like to see a Pokémon with\n",
        "a Quirky nature."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Qu’est-ce que j’aimerais voir...\r",
        "J’aimerais voir un Pokémon Bizarre."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SunyshoreCityEastHouse_Text_IllGiveCalendarApp",
      "en_US": [
        "Yep! Your {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} has\n",
